{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Rfm1qq3YHM1795748743.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>陳自瑤（Yoyo）早前出席《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》時，以一襲高衩黑色戰衣驚艷全場。26日，Yoyo在社交平台公開了多張當晚的幕後靚相，令一班粉絲大飽眼福！</p><p></p><p>這套戰衣的剪裁極具特色，高衩設計配襯心口蝴蝶結細節，不僅完美勾勒出Yoyo的弗爆身形及健美曲線，亦令其一雙纖細美腿一覽無遺，可謂性感與甜美並存。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"13e3b867-d3fe-4c9a-9885-09143d784867.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Fmq9eMKAM01795748743.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"9a153353-45cf-4d3e-beb6-497f9a50ff86.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026rwEy9mXvMQ1795748742.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>相片曝光後，隨即引得大批圈中好友及網民洗版式激讚，紛紛大讚Yoyo狀態極佳，又靚又Fit；而好友陳煒更直言她優雅得猶如一隻黑天鵝！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.956290+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T03:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:57:14.400473+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:14.543571+00:00","content_hash":"9f6c50000842d622982308e1847183c2d1a98c99d355214b11da2278aab6ad31","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.956290+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}